  browser_module_plan_sampler_cap_2026_06_28: Route `module_plan_sampler_candidate_cap=1024`, Module Plan `Sampler Cap`, fixed-buffer Top K clamping, and `module-plan-sampler-cap-drift` assertions through wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/browser-module-plan-sampler-cap-memory-2026-06-28.md.
  browser_module_plan_count_drift_2026_06_28: Route selector-to-receipt module cardinality, `module_plan_module_count` versus `module_count`, and `module-plan-count-drift` assertions through wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/browser-module-plan-count-drift-memory-2026-06-28.md.
  site_voice_strategy_rule: .uai/taboo.uai governs model-breeding, mutualist, tiny-ecology, UAIX strategy, and public website copy for this site; public copy should simply use proof, craft, lineage, fit, local agency, routes, and evidence.
long_term_pointer_rule:
  link_only_not_context_free: true
  summary_rule: Routing-only, one sentence, 35 words maximum, no body memory.
  statuses: current, retired, superseded, quarantined
  file_targets_need_checksum: true
file_handoff_rule:
  active_buckets: agent-file-handoff/Content/, agent-file-handoff/Improvement/
  source_site_archive_default: forbidden
  completion_gate: live bucket scan, disposition ledger, actual work outcome, hot-memory update, durable preservation evidence, checks, blockers, and source-site removal unless a named keep-active exception or blocker is recorded.
  report_processing_gate: For large report batches, preserve raw/docs originals, create distributed durable synthesis, populate typed .uai summaries, update pointer ledger, and remove processed source-site copies so active buckets return to empty or placeholder-only unless a named keep-active exception or blocker exists.
  2026_06_26_batch_rule: Model-breeding reports route through raw/runtime-mirust/report-intake-2026-06-26/, wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/model-breeding-ecology-memory-2026-06-26.md, and wiki/runtime-mirust/research/model-breeding-reference-ideas-2026-06-26.md.
  2026_06_28_research_batch_rule: ModelBreeder and zero-dependency research routes through raw/runtime-mirust/report-intake-2026-06-28/, wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/report-intake-index-2026-06-28.md, and wiki/runtime-mirust/research/modelbreeder-zero-dependency-reference-ideas-2026-06-28.md.
  2026_06_29_research_batch_rule: Tiny model and runtime research routes through raw/runtime-mirust/report-intake-2026-06-29/, wiki/runtime-mirust/reports/report-intake-index-2026-06-29.md, and wiki/runtime-mirust/research/tiny-model-runtime-memory-reference-ideas-2026-06-29.md.
  2026_06_30_docs_report_batch_rule: Nine new Improvement reports are preserved under docs/report-intake/2026-06-30/ with checksum-bound docs copies, a manifest, and a synthesis; active source-site copies were removed after preservation and active intake is now empty or placeholder-only.
  2026_07_01_minimodel_docs_report_batch_rule: Seven MiniModel.org Improvement reports, one Hugging Face API option report, the SLM Composer UI plan, and the dashboard redesign batch are preserved under docs/report-intake/2026-07-01/ with checksum-bound docs copies, manifest routes, MiniModel/dashboard syntheses, roadmap/research routes, and SLMComposer dashboard memory; active source-site copies were removed after preservation and active intake is now empty or placeholder-only.
